RGB MoCap's _MyTools/export/biped_fingers.py adapts the Biped wrist/finger encoder
from FlowHMR-Windows, inspected 2026-11-25.
Source: https://github.com/xiaoerofficial021-collab/FlowHMR-Windows
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0; reproduced in LICENSE in this directory.

The calibration constants were measured against the default 3ds Max 2026.3
five-finger, three-link Biped. RGB MoCap resolves source joints by BVH names
and calibrates from each exported rest hierarchy, including terminal tips.
The measured single-axis regression probes are in
_MyTools/tests/fixtures/biped_2026_finger_probes.json.

Autodesk 3ds Max is separately installed and licensed. No Autodesk binaries,
user motion, video or body model files are included with this adaptation.
